        "headline": "UPS波音767貨機在邁阿密機場未依指示讓行 Copa波音737客機翼尖撞上貨機機鼻 2人輕傷",
        "summary": "週六晚間，Copa航空427號班機與UPS航空358號貨運班機在邁阿密國際機場滑行時相撞。UPS機組未依航管指示讓行，剛抵達的波音737-800客機翼尖撞上準備起飛的波音767-300F貨機機鼻。兩人現場接受輕傷治療，無需送醫；美國聯邦航空總署已展開調查，兩機損傷程度尚未正式確認。",
        "headline_en": "UPS 767 fails to give way at Miami airport; Copa 737 wingtip strikes freighter's nose, leaving two with minor injuries",
        "summary_en": "On Saturday evening, Copa Airlines flight 427 and UPS Airlines flight 358 collided while taxiing at Miami International Airport. The UPS crew did not give way as instructed by air traffic control, and the wingtip of the recently arrived Boeing 737-800 struck the nose of the Boeing 767-300F, which was taxiing for departure. Two people were treated for minor injuries and did not need hospital transport. The US Federal Aviation Administration is investigating; the extent of damage to both aircraft has not been officially confirmed.",
